window.products.push({"id":555011,"name":"Bartnelli Heavy Duty Ironing Board 48x15 | Designed & Made in Europe with Patent Technology, Turbo & Park Zone, Features: 4 Layer Cover &Pad,Height-Ad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D10rS+ZsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"EUROPEAN QUALITY BUILT - With years of research and development, Bartnelli finally comes up with a revolutionary design that “irons” out every Ironing Board issue. This product is designed in the Netherlands and made in Europe so you can ensure efficient performance that will do the job in the most convenient way possible. PATENTED IRONING BOARD TECHNOLOGY- Our Iron Boards are equipped with 2 unique features: Parking Zone and Turbo Zone. The Parking Zone is a special area on the board that allows you to sit your hot iron flat without burning the surface. The Turbo Zone allows you to reset the iron’s smoothness when its plate gets a bit harder to slide on the fabric. 4-LAYER, EXTRA-THICK PAD & COVER - This Iron Board measures 48x15 inches. It is covered with an extra-thick pad and cover that provide a good cushion for ironing while permitting the absorption of excess steam – resulting in a faster ironing process. Each board comes with an upgraded innovative iron rest that has a cord holder, so the wire doesn't get in the way. HEAVY-DUTY STEEL LEGS - Reinforced with high-quality steel legs, our Ironing Board ditches the wobbly work of ironing in most Iron Tables. It's premium heavy-duty 4 legs ensure matchless durability and stability. With Its Intelligent lock technology. Storage is never a problem as it is easily foldable & height adjustable from 27\" to 38\" TURBO ZONE ADVANTAGES - This newly developed Patent technology will further help you cut your ironing time in half, by gliding over the turbo zone with your iron 3 times to activate the Easy-Glide Iron. it will make your iron glide so smoothly you wont believe your own eyes, but Rest-Assured it is real, with years in research and development we are glad to finally bring the latest innovation to your ironing, straight from Europe PARK ZONE ADVANTAGES - This newly developed fabric is woven with steel in the cotton to allow a hot iron to sit on the Park Zone for 10 minutes without any damage or discolor, and is safe enough to keep up to 72 Hours without burning it. This allows you to make a coffee or see who is at the door during ironing, it can cut your ironing time in hal: since you wont need to place the iron up between ironing different areas of the clothing, u just leave it on the park zone. YOUR SAFETY AS OUR #1 PRIORITY - Your iron can stay hot for up to another 30 minutes after you unplug it. That’s where the Parking Zone becomes a lot more beneficial. Instead of putting it in the iron rest, you can simply lay it flat in the Park Zone and let it cool there before storage. It keeps the hot iron safe from accidental touch, especially for kids and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D10rS+ZsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bartnelli","source_asin":"B09WH8VFCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WH8VFCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WH8VFCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
