window.products.push({"id":555227,"name":"MIER Mens Insulated Lunch Box, Dual Compartment Large Lunch Bag Coolers with Shoulder Strap for Men Women Adult to Office Work, Picnic, Travel, Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OnK2+XB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Decker Lunch Bag for Men】Mens lunch box bag features with two insulated sections allowing you to pack hot and cold food separately. Top dry compartment is for fruits, chips and other snacks. Bottom leakproof compartment is for lunch boxes, bento boxes, sandwiches, food containers, drinks and so on. Keep your food organized 【Insulated and Leakproof Lunch Cooler】The exterior of MIER lunchbag is made of high-quality polyester material, which is durable, rip resistant, lightweight and water-resistant. The interior combined of thick insulation and eco-friendly PEVA liner (BPA free) keeps food fresh for a period of time 【Large Capacity Lunch Box】Upper compartment: 11.75\" L x 8\" W x 4.5\" H; Bottom compartment: 11.75\" L x8\" W x 6\" H; Weight: 660g/1.46lbs. MIER big lunch box is ideal for food, snacks, drinks, fruit, or vegetable for your healthy meals. Designed with 1 large front zippered pouch for cards, phone, wallet and others, and 2 side mesh pockets for your drinks, napkins or other small stuff. The lunch cooler provides 2 main sections for spacious room and orderly storage 【Comfortable and Easy Carrying】The detachable and adjustable shoulder strap is for easy carrying and freeing your hands. A soft handle on the top provides a cozy grasp. Provide 2 ways to carry the lunch bag and comfortable carrying for a long time 【Versatile Cooler Lunch Bags】Ideal to use as men work lunch bag, beach cooler bag, family picnic lunch cooler, adults lunchbox cooler, women lunch tote bag, etc. Perfect for picnics, travel, camping, park, road trip or other outdoor activities. A great gift for both men and women","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OnK2+XB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIER","source_asin":"B09TFDVKY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TFDVKY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TFDVKY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555228,"name":"KAHLA Five Senses Small Bowl 5-1/2 Inches, White Color, 1 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ae4I5aSzL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"The clean lines of the shallow and deep FIVE SENSES bowls are almost straight but have a fine curve. The small FIVE SENSES bowl is perfect for small salads and desserts. Do you love to lend a hand in the kitchen – even if there is not time for a grand meal every day? FIVE SENSES is porcelain for people who enjoy cooking and eating with all their senses. Many clever details surprise with ingenuity or put a smile on your face. The cups are slightly shifted off-centre on the saucers to allow more space for spoons, sugar cubes and chocolate biscuits. The spoon fits under the lid of the sugar bowl – we call it Sugar loaf. The cut of the plates is slanted – this prevents spills and crumbs on the table but also allows an easier access for knife, fork and spoon. There are beautiful bowls in all proportions and sizes imaginable and baking tins for delicious dishes from the oven. Whether on wood, stainless steel or glass: in brilliant white, FIVE SENSES is the ideal partner for every well-stocked kitchen and on every table of food lovers. FIVE SENSES was awarded eight international design awards. Kahla porcelain is dishwasher safe, microwave safe and ovenproof. We hope you enjoy our products made in Germany using environmentally and socially sustainable production practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ae4I5aSzL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAHLA - PORCELAIN FOR THE SENSES","source_asin":"B0033A7BU6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0033A7BU6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0033A7BU6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555229,"name":"Fox Valley Traders Personalized I Said A Christmas Prayer Christmas Card Set of 20, Front of Envelope Personalization with Design Only","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FH0tmDFuL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"Inside: I Said a Christmas Prayer for You because the season's near. I didn't ask for riches but for gifts so much more dear. I asked for joyful gatherings with your family all around, and for carols to inspire you with their old familiar sound. I asked for quiet moments in your heart on Christmas morn, for a special time to celebrate the Savior who was born...I asked for friends to send their best that you might know they care. I asked for peace and love and hope, and I know God heard my prayer. Holiday home in grandiose decor warms hearts for Christmas Features inside Scripture verse from Philippians 1:34. Glossy card stock single folds to 4 1/2\" x 6 1/4\"; coordinating envelopes included.Personalization: Specify names as they are to be printed on the cards. Please note: At this time, we are only able to personalize characters from the English keyboard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FH0tmDFuL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Valley Traders","source_asin":"B0BDH8WJG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDH8WJG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDH8WJG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555230,"name":"8 Door/Window Stickers Compatible with Vivint Systems","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vcXthTcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 Home security window decals Ward off potential intruders by placing our home security surveillance stickers at strategic locations around your home to further highlight the fact you have an operating alarm system, which will contribute to scaring off any illegal activity. Durable security surveillance window decals Made from high-quality, premium vinyl, these are made for outdoor or indoor use. Double Sided for easy placement. Sizing and pack information Included in your purchase you will receive 8 stick-on window or door decals to place around your property. BUY NOW and protect your property to the max with our video/alarm surveillance window decals!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vcXthTcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Window Decals","source_asin":"B09GGCXHX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GGCXHX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GGCXHX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
