window.products.push({"id":555327,"name":"CrystalAge Rose Quartz Money Toad - 40mm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ZrjwbYAeL._AC_.jpg","description":"With its pretty colour and auspicious design, this Rose Quartz Money Toad is a great little piece. The Rose Quartz has a lovely pale pink colour and is slightly translucent, so it looks even better when placed near a window. The three-legged money toad is a mythical Chinese creature believed to protect and increase wealth, as well as bringing luck. He has three legs, sits on a pile of money and holds a Chinese coin in his mouth. According to Feng Shui, money toads should be placed in key areas of the home to bring good fortune and increased wealth. Rose Quartz is known as the 'Stone of Love' and it is believed to attract and encourage all forms of love. It is also a comforting crystal, recommended for depression or grief. This crystal money toad is a lovely addition to your home and would make a great gift for any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ZrjwbYAeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B007C2YRX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007C2YRX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007C2YRX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555328,"name":"Broken Chain Wood Plaque - Made in the USA - 5.5x12 - Classy Frame Wall Hanging Decoration | We little knew that morning that God was going to call yo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nHrXx0MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👭 MADE IN THE USA OF THE FINEST MATERIALS – This Marriage Prayer is 100% made in the USA, we believe in quality and only sell products that last for a long time. Our Wood Plaque is made of fine wood that looks elegant and will never fade or break easily. Dexsa has been manufacturing unique products for the gift market for over twenty-five years. Each piece is handcrafted to ensure you are receiving the quality you deserve at an affordable price. 👭 ELEGANT VERSATILE DECORATION – Looking for a nice wall decoration with a beautiful meaningful quote? Includes a keyhole on the back for hanging. This is the perfect gift to remember and commemorate a loss. It will inspire every time they read it. Measures 5 1/2 inches x 12 inches. 👭 RUSTIC STYLE - With reclaimed wood background brings a fresh and rustic style that highlights its rugged and natural beauty. It embraces nature-inspired textures, simple and earthy colors that brings organic warmth at home or working place. 👭 THE BROKEN CHAIN – “We little knew that morning that God was going to call your name. In life we loved you dearly, in death we do the same. It broke our hearts to lose you, you did not go lone; for part of us went with you, the day God called you home. You left us peaceful memories, your love is still our guide & though we cannot see you, you are always at our side. Our family chain is broken, and nothing seems the same; but as God calls us one by one, the chain will link again.” 👭 WONDERFUL GIFT - An inspiring, lovely gift to the family or friends closes to your heart or to anyone you like to give a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nHrXx0MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dexsa","source_asin":"B08CZL3G2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZL3G2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZL3G2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
