window.products.push({"id":555614,"name":"GLLBTPT 6 Pcs Popsicles Molds,Reusable Baby Silicone Popsicle Molds Multi Colors Ice Cream Mold Tray Ice Froze with Lids for DIY Popsicles,Yogurt Stic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KTHSYagrL._AC_.jpg","description":"DIY Creative Popsicle:With these popsicle molds, you can make popsicles or ice creams of various flavors.Add a variety of fruits, juice,jelly,yogurt,chocolate,and other foods you like.Enjoy the fun of DIY with the children and have a cool summer. High-Quality Materials:Silicone ice cube trays with lids made of food grade silicone, food grade silicon, BPA Free high quality materials, the silicone ice cube trays Which can used for adult & baby food. Anti-leakage Design:As the anti-leakage double rings design,The lid stays on tight, so you can easily freeze them standing upright on the lid.Our stackable silicone ice cube with a lid that prevents ice from absorbing other food air in the refrigerator. Easy to Use:The popsicle Models is easy to release the complete shape,good flexibility,recoverable after torsion,non-stick performance and easy demolding.After taking out the ice pop molds from the fridge, just leave it for a few minutes or run freeze molds under warm water for easily slide out the ice pops. Durable & Reusable: Popsicles molds are durable and reusable. This means you no longer need to waste money on buying popsicles, popsicle bags and popsicle sticks. Ice pop molds are easy to clean. You can clean popsicle maker directly with water, or use a brush or dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KTHSYagrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLLBTPT","source_asin":"B09XWHPV6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XWHPV6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XWHPV6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
