window.products.push({"id":555635,"name":"Hyoola 16\" Beeswax Taper Candles - 16 Hour Burn Time - White Beeswax Candles - 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dj-pU617L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great decoration, amazing functionality - that's the Hyoola way and our bee wax candle tapered is the best way to keep rooms beautifully lit while adding a classy touch to your decor. Made from 100% organic beeswax and handcrafted right here in the USA, you're getting the best of the best with our beeswax organic tall candles. Their tapered design allows them to fit most candlesticks and candle holders easily. Premium grade beeswax guarantees extreme durability and usability. PRODUCT FEATURES 4 Pack16 Inches Tall (400mm)0.75 Inch Diameter (20mm)Tapered DesignNatural White Color100% Premium BeeswaxLead-free 100% Cotton WickNatural Beeswax ScentHandmade in the USA QUALITY BEESWAX TAPER CANDLES Get the best beeswax candle available with Hyoola ! The quality produced organic candle made from 100% pure natural beeswax will emit a soft beeswax fragrance that will fill up your home for a truly soothing experience. The natural state of beeswax is that they burn a lot longer than regular wax candles for a truly organic experience. They will remain lit for 16 hours so you know you're getting incredible usage out of them. Our beeswax candles scented are virtually dripless to create minimal mess. This makes them a lot easier to remove and replace whenever you need to fill up the room with new light and fresh scents. ELEGANT DESIGN Sleek tapered construction allows it to be a perfect decorative piece in any room. They fit in most taper candle holders for a sophisticated appearance. They are a natural white color which is ideal especially when using them as a source of light and also for presentation. The yellow color will fit in all types of settings no matter what kind of style you're going for. BRIGHTEN YOUR DAY Brighten your table decor, your religious decoration, enhance any type of ceremony, party or special event with these beeswax candles tapers from Hyoola.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dj-pU617L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08XY72M5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY72M5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY72M5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
