window.products.push({"id":555646,"name":"Threadmill Luxury Organic Cotton Sheets - GOTS Certified 4 Piece King Sage Green Percale Sheets Set, Breathable, Eco-Friendly Premium Sheet Set - Smoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnF5gXIwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CERTIFIED 100% ORGANIC COTTON SHEETS: Say no to harmful fabrics anymore and enjoy a peaceful and healthier sleep. Our organic cotton sheets are certified by Global Organic Textile Standards (GOTS) - world's top standard for textile processing. Our sheets are harmless and are gentle on all skin types. They are extremely soft and breathable which makes them safe for kids, toddlers and pets as well. Unlike other sellers, we display our certification on our products and are completely authentic. HIGH QUALITY LUXURY FOR YOUR HEALTH: Being the purest form of cotton, organic sheets offer crisp smooth feel and cooling providing the best comfort of world-class hotel. These sheets are durable, have smooth finish and their softness increases after every wash. Organic sheets do not contain any harmful chemicals or toxins and are easy on your skin. Each King Sheet Set contains 1 Fitted Sheet (78 X 80 \" + 16\" Deep Pocket), 1 Flat Sheet (110 X 104 \") and 2 King Pillow Cases (20 X 40 \"). CRISP SOFTNESS WITH PERCALE WEAVE: These high quality sheets are carefully crafted with Percale weave for supreme softness and smoothness, beating the best of high thread count sheets. Unlike fleece sheets, organic sheets do not pill and last long. The long fibers ensure the products have better strength, low-shrinkage and makes them durable. As no chemicals are used in organic sheets, the bedding set is super soft and has a luxurious touch that makes your bedroom aesthetically appealing. EASY FIT DESIGN FOR HASSLE-FREE SLEEP: To ensure flawless fit, our sheets have 360° elastic to fit your mattress perfectly securing the corners. The sheets also have a tag to indicate top and foot side which helps in making the bed in no time. Our sheets need basic care - Machine wash with cold water and tumble dry on low heat. Iron on low heat setting if required. Do not use bleach and fabric softeners. Sleep peacefully and hassle-free knowing that your bedding needs are taken care of. ECO-FRIENDLY PACKAGING - All Threadmill products are manufactured sustainably and our processes are certified by OEKO - TEX. Our fabric is tested at each stage to ensure no-synthetic usage. We follow no-plastic packaging policy and our products come in a multipurpose cotton bag. Our sheets make a perfect gift for any event - Christmas, Father's-Mother's Day, Valentines and more. If you do not like our product, you can return them for a full refund within 30 days as per Amazon's policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnF5gXIwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B0B85BNC3L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B85BNC3L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B85BNC3L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
