window.products.push({"id":555676,"name":"Book Lovers Gifts for Women Gifts for Book Lovers Book Accessories for Reading Lovers Gifts for Readers Gifts for People Who Like to Read Bookish Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917FR+q7NNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size and Material: 60x50 inches, 127x152cm, printed on one side, composed of polyester, made of high-quality facecloth for a softer and more comfortable. Book lover gifts: For book lovers, there is no more lasting and satisfying entertainment than reading. For them, books are an ocean of knowledge and a world of spirit, and reading opens their eyes and makes it easier for them to deal with the problems of life. Give them this special gift, so that they can read and feel warm at the same time. Warm and Comfortable Blanket: Our blanket is light and warm, covering your body is like having a warm embrace. Soft and comfortable, with a nice feel, more comfortable than normal blankets. Wrinkle-resistant and non-pilling can be used for a long time, made of high-quality flannel, still as good as new after washing. Single-sided printing design, the bright colors are fully integrated into each fiber. Great for Gift-Giving: book lovers gifts blankets are gifts for book lovers, book accessories for reading lovers, gifts for readers, book club gifts, gifts for people who like to read, bookish gifts, librarian gifts, bookworm gifts, Literature lover, student, teacher, writer, daughter, son, dad, mom, sister, brother, schoolmate. It can also be used as a birthday gift, school opening gift, teacher's day gift. Christmas gift, Mother's Day gift, Thanksgiving gift, Valentine's Day gift, Memorial gift, New Year gift. Beautiful Vibe: Book lovers gifts are not just a blanket, it is a work of art. It is suitable for use in reading, watching movies, cars, airplanes, beds, sofas, offices, classrooms, air-conditioned rooms, library, classroom, lounging, napping, and as a bed sheet that blends perfectly with your interior decor. It can also be folded up and taken out for camping, travel, and anywhere you want to go. Having it is the equivalent of having a warm embrace and not being afraid of the cold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917FR+q7NNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puekrtoa","source_asin":"B0BCVBMVKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCVBMVKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCVBMVKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
