window.products.push({"id":555757,"name":"HeyDreamy Puckered Diamond 3-Piece Quilt Set, Stone Washed, Soft Quilted Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtZpYxA-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Add Comfort and Style to Your Bedroom Enjoy in dreamy soft comfort with this HeyDreamy 3 pc bedding set. The bedding set includes a super soft quilted comforter design that adds freshness to your room. The coverlet is ideal for year-round use with its ultra soft material that remains cool in the summer and warm in the winter. Pre-Washed, Quality Microfiber Designed for comfort and durability, the bedding set is made from pre-washed microfiber material with a brushed finish. Its microfiber material is wrinkle-resistant for long-lasting wear and ultra durability. Easy Care: Machine Washable and Dryer Friendly The bedding set is easy to care for. Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle. Wash dark colors separately. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low heat. Iron on low heat if needed. . Free Gift: Each HeyDreamy purchase comes with a complimentary dreamcatcher (while supplies last). To avoid danger of suffocation, keep the plastic bag away from infants and children. Do not use the bag in cribs, beds, carriages, or play pens. This bag is not a toy. CHOKING HAZARD - Not for children under 3 years. Use with adult supervision. About HeyDreamy HeyDreamy began with a simple philosophy that every day is an opportunity to follow your dreams and enjoy life. By going direct-to-consumer, HeyDreamy is able to weave style and comfort into every room of the home at an exceptional value. As an award winning manufacturer of many global prestigious bedding brands, HeyDreamy cares deeply about the impact our business has on local communities and the environment. All of HeyDreamy collections are crafted with care through eco-friendly techniques and sustainable practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtZpYxA-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeyDreamy","source_asin":"B07PYYR36N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PYYR36N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PYYR36N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
