window.products.push({"id":555883,"name":"Nanshing Lincoln Collection Bedroom Comforter Set, Complete 7 Piece Set, Red, King (Lincoln-K)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CIr3Yg68L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Achieve that lasting luxurious flair to your bed with this Lincoln Comforter Set, featuring seven pieces for a complete ensemble. The king size comforter measures 101\" L in. x 86\" W in. with a 1.5-inch thickness for insulating comfort. The two standard pillow shams measure 37\" L in. x 21\" W in. There are three decorative pillows measuring 16\" L in. x 16\" W in., 12\" L in. x 16\" W in., and 16\" L in. x 6.5\" W in. There is an included bed skirt measuring 72\" L in. x 84\" W in. with a 14-inch drop that covers the base of the bed. The comforter and the rest of the items feature 100% polyester fabric and polyester fill for total insulation and comfort.  A gorgeous set featuring bright red and gold floral design on a background of black and gray.  At Nanshing, we sought to blend artistry and design. By making fantastic designs and stunning combinations, we create fine bedroom textiles that offers great value for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CIr3Yg68L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nanshing","source_asin":"B01MZ4HDP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ4HDP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ4HDP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555884,"name":"Oneida Capello 3-Piece Serving Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C5VDVH7RL._AC_.jpg","description":"The bold yet simple look of Capello adds panache to a casual or formal table. The knife's artful sweep is a true inspiration. Great for family dining or entertaining, combining durability with a lustrous finish. Oneida, the leading name in flatware, has been setting tables for generations. Oneida's highest quality stainless flatware, the 3-piece serving set includes: large serving fork, butter knife and pierced spoon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C5VDVH7RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B0000B1TK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000B1TK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000B1TK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":555885,"name":"Royal Albert 100 Years of Royal Albert Set, Holyrood, 3-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x6ZRjlWPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Royal Doulton announces the international launch of the 100 Years of Royal Albert collection, celebrating a century of English craftsmanship through ten patterns representing design trends of each decade of the 20th century. Royal Albert’s success dates back to the late 1800’s, and the new collection celebrates the brand’s vitality, longevity and rich design history. The collection features all bone china with 22 karat gold accents on teacups, saucers, plates, mugs, teapots, creamers, sugar bowls and figurines. Every pattern included in the collection captures the true historical design statements and trends of each time period. Featuring Royal Albert brand signature delicate florals in many of the patterns, all items from the 100 Years of Royal Albert collection are packaged in unique deep pink and burgundy Royal Albert hatboxes with illustrations of all ten patterns. 1980 Holyrood: featuring a majestic and formal burgundy and gold border that echoes the era of wealth and power dressing. Amazon.com As it embarks on a new century of fine china design, Royal Albert honors the artistic achievements of the one it has so faithfully chronicled with this stunning 100 Years of Royal Albert tribute collection. Employing classic shapes and delicate floral motifs, the 10-part series, which includes teaware, figurines, and brooches, recalls major British historical events and style trends from each decade of the 21st century. Inspiration for the series came from previous Royal Albert designs and its archive pattern books. The collection's 10 three-piece sets are a wonderfully social way to tell the entire story, and this 1980 \"Holyrood\" makes a lovely chapter. Crafted of bone china with 22-karat gold trim on gracefully scalloped shapes, the teacup, saucer, and dessert plate represent the decade of Prince Charles and Lady Diana's fairytale wedding and the \"Me\" generation of wealth and status seekers. The design departs from the earlier floral patterns with a deep burgundy border and a regal gold decorative motif that reflects this decade's preference for formal dining. Each piece has a special commemorative backstamp, and the set comes packaged in a presentation-style pink and burgundy hatbox with depictions of all the patterns. The china is dishwasher-safe and carries a two-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x6ZRjlWPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Albert","source_asin":"B0014TFJQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014TFJQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014TFJQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
