window.products.push({"id":555940,"name":"Wooden Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Sustainable Acacia Wood, 8\" - Elegant Pepper and Salt Grinder Set for Seasoning, Cooking, Dining - Perfect Salt an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ytgRcZucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PERFECT ENTERTAINER'S ADDITION: As anyone with a passion for cooking and entertaining can attest, presentation is just as important as the food itself! This gorgeous set of Acacia Wood Salt and Pepper Grinders will add a stunning feature to any dining setting. Made from sustainable acacia wood grown in accredited plantations, the beautiful wood grain is unique to each pepper grinder and sea salt grinder. Our quality Merazi Living salt and pepper mill set will add sophistication to any meal. FRESH SEASONING , EVERYTIME: Salt and pepper mills are largely preferred over traditional salt and pepper shakers because the salt crystals and black peppercorn are ground on command, so you are getting the freshest seasoning available! The grinding mechanism is comprised of heavy-duty ceramic and stainless steel materials, lending itself to optimal, smooth performance. You will love the modern look and feel of this wooden pepper and salt grinder set as well as the smoth and easy manual grind. LOW-MAINTENANCE : Our large wooden mills require very little maintenance, so you can focus on more important things. Each 8\" tall refillable salt and pepper grinder set can house a significant amount of granules so you won't be constantly refilling them. To fill your grinders, simply unscrew the metal top and remove the wood cover, then fill with your favorite sea, himalayan, celtic salt or black pepper corn. Clean by using a damp cloth or brush. TOP-NOTCH CRAFTSMANSHIP: Our pepper mill grinder and sea salt grinder set comprises of acacia wood, naturally creating that desired grain finish that makes this set so exquisite looking. Aside from its beauty, acacia wood is an ideal material because it is incredibly durable and naturally water-resistant, which means it safeguards your salt and pepper from collecting moisture . Built with high-quality stainless steel and ceramic, these grinders guarantee flawless performance for years to come. THE PERFECT GIFT SET: Our decorative salt and pepper shakers perfectly blend elegant workmanship with high-performance , making the Merazi Living salt n pepper grinders a great present option for a special event or for that special someone. This modern farmhouse style set, accessorized in a rustic-chic eco friendly gift box, is perfect for a wedding, anniversary, birthday, housewarming, or a holiday like Christmas or Valentine's Day. Why not pop it on your wedding registry items list!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ytgRcZucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merazi Living","source_asin":"B07GWCKHPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-555940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GWCKHPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GWCKHPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
